<view class="page">
  <view class="card">
    <view class="title">🎯 每周上冰目标（分钟）</view>
      <view class="goal-row">
        <input class="input goal-input" type="number" value="{{goal}}" bindinput="setGoal" placeholder="例如 360" />
        <button class="btn goal-btn" bindtap="saveGoal">保存</button>
      </view>
      <view class="goal-chips">
        <view class="chip" data-v="180" bindtap="quickGoal">180</view>
        <view class="chip" data-v="270" bindtap="quickGoal">270</view>
        <view class="chip" data-v="360" bindtap="quickGoal">360</view>
        <view class="chip" data-v="450" bindtap="quickGoal">450</view>
        <view class="chip" data-v="540" bindtap="quickGoal">540</view>
      </view>
      <view class="muted goal-hint">点上方数字可快速选；用于「月度概览」参考</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="title">📈 次数基线（开始记录前已录的次数）</view>
    <view class="muted">早期记录不全时，填上这个基线，让「回顾」里的累计「上冰/上课」次数更准确。</view>
    <view class="goal-row">
      <view class="base-lb">上冰基线</view>
      <input class="input goal-input" type="number" value="{{iceBase}}" bindinput="setIceBase" placeholder="0" />
    </view>
    <view class="goal-row">
      <view class="base-lb">上课基线</view>
      <input class="input goal-input" type="number" value="{{lessonBase}}" bindinput="setLessonBase" placeholder="0" />
    </view>
    <button class="btn goal-btn-full" bindtap="saveBase">保存基线</button>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="title">☁️ 云同步</view>
    <view class="kv">
      <text class="kv-label">当前身份</text>
      <text class="kv-val">{{openid || '获取中…'}}</text>
      <text class="copy-link" wx:if="{{openid}}" bindtap="copyOpenid">复制</text>
    </view>
    <view class="kv"><text class="kv-label">AI 教练</text><text class="kv-val">{{aiStatus}}</text></view>
    <view class="kv"><text class="kv-label">上次同步</text><text class="kv-val">{{syncStatus}}</text></view>
    <view class="kv"><text class="kv-label">数据在哪</text><text class="kv-val">{{dataWhere}}</text></view>
    <view class="sync-err" wx:if="{{syncErr}}">⚠️ {{syncErr}}</view>
    <view class="muted dev-note">删除小程序会清空本机数据；重新打开时会自动从云端恢复（前提是之前上传成功过）。所以别只依赖本机，重要数据请定期「导出为文件」。</view>
    <view class="auto-row">
      <view class="auto-info">
        <view class="auto-title">自动同步</view>
        <view class="muted auto-sub">保持开启：改动几秒后自动上传云端，删小程序/换手机时能恢复</view>
      </view>
      <switch checked="{{auto}}" bindchange="toggleAuto" color="#0284c7" />
    </view>
    <view class="btn-row">
      <button class="ghost-btn half" bindtap="cloudPull">☁️ 从云端恢复（合并）</button>
      <button class="ghost-btn half" bindtap="overview">📊 数据概览</button>
    </view>
    <view class="muted pull-hint">「从云端恢复」只补不删，随时可以点，点了不会丢任何东西。</view>
    <view class="diag" bindtap="rollback">⏮ 找回云端历史版本</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="title">💾 数据备份 / 迁移</view>
    <view class="muted">「导出」生成一份 JSON 备份或迁移到其它设备；「导入」可合并网页版 / 其它设备的备份。</view>
    <view class="btn-row">
      <button class="ghost-btn half" bindtap="exportFile">💾 导出为文件</button>
      <button class="ghost-btn half" bindtap="chooseImportFile">📂 导入文件</button>
    </view>
    <view class="btn-row">
      <button class="ghost-btn" bindtap="toggleImport">📥 粘贴导入</button>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{showImport}}">
      <view class="muted">粘贴 JSON 备份内容（会自动合并去重）：</view>
      <textarea class="textarea" value="{{importText}}" bindinput="setImportText" placeholder="粘贴 JSON 备份内容…" maxlength="-1"></textarea>
      <button class="btn" bindtap="doImport">导入</button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="adv-toggle" bindtap="toggleAdv">{{advOn ? '▾' : '▸'}} 🔧 高级 / 数据排查（平时不用）</view>
    <block wx:if="{{advOn}}">
      <view class="muted">这里都是排查与修复工具，日常使用不需要。操作前建议先「导出为文件」备份。</view>
      <view class="guard {{guardOk ? 'ok' : 'bad'}}">{{guardText}}</view>
      <view class="btn-row">
        <button class="ghost-btn half" bindtap="diagnose">🔍 同步诊断</button>
        <button class="ghost-btn half" bindtap="extras">🔎 多出的记录</button>
      </view>
      <view class="btn-row">
        <button class="ghost-btn half" bindtap="restoreRecords">↩︎ 恢复导入前</button>
        <button class="ghost-btn half" bindtap="copyExamsRaw">📋 复制考级原始数据</button>
      </view>
      <view class="btn-row">
        <button class="ghost-btn" bindtap="dedupeRecords">🧹 合并重复记录（同日期+同类型+同方式）</button>
      </view>
      <view class="btn-row">
        <button class="ghost-btn" bindtap="restoreUpgrade">⬆︎ 恢复升级前数据<text wx:if="{{snapText}}">（{{snapText}}）</text></button>
      </view>
      <view class="danger-zone">
        <view class="muted">下面两个操作会**覆盖或清掉**数据，普通使用不需要；点之前请先「导出为文件」。</view>
        <view class="btn-row">
          <button class="ghost-btn danger half" bindtap="cloudUpload">⬆️ 用本机覆盖云端</button>
          <button class="ghost-btn danger half" bindtap="clearData">🧨 清空本机数据</button>
        </view>
        <view class="muted">· 「用本机覆盖云端」= 把云端那份换成你本机现在的样子（云端旧版会自动存进历史，可回滚）<br/>· 「清空本机数据」= 只清本机，云端那份还在，之后可以点「从云端恢复」拉回来</view>
      </view>
    </block>
  </view>
</view>
